    "implementation_delta": "Add HermeticProofSealQualificationSurface@1 and ProofSealQualification@1. Hermetic exact-byte put/get, candidate versus current separation, fresh verification before reuse, proving-key and witness rejection, WAL, restart, stale-parent rejection, concurrent writers, tombstone, invalidation, corruption, and legacy-certificate staging without admission were measured_hermetic. Live IPFS proof-artifact transport stays typed unavailable: the sealed PATH has no ipfs executable and this qualifier did not start a daemon. Injected or hermetic adapters cannot mint live qualification. CLI/MCP/MCP++ proof-seal parity stays typed unavailable (PCPR-026). This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
